Keep a shared source as empty text.
Place "Alice@Example.com" into source.
Keep a shared bigletters as empty text.
Place "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ" into bigletters.
Keep a shared smallletters as empty text.
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into smallletters.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared converted as empty text.
Keep a shared softened as empty text.
Keep a shared domaintext as empty text.
Keep a shared line as empty text.
Keep a shared digits as empty text.
Keep a shared lowdigit as empty text.
Place "0" into lowdigit.
Keep a shared highdigit as empty text.
Place "9" into highdigit.
Keep a shared foundspot as 0.

To lower from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 25, return.
The bigpiece is the slice of bigletters from spot to spot plus 1.
If bigpiece matches current, set converted to the slice of smallletters from spot to spot plus 1, return.
Lower from spot plus 1.

To soften from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of domaintext, return.
Set current to the slice of domaintext from spot to spot plus 1.
Set converted to current.
Lower from 0.
Place converted into softened.
Soften from spot plus 1.

To pad from count (a whole number) with limit (a whole number).
If count is at least limit, return.
Place "*" into line.
Pad from count plus 1 with limit.

To findat from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of source, return.
The piece is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches "@", set foundspot to spot, return.
Findat from spot plus 1.

To veil.
Findat from 0.
The person is the slice of source from 0 to foundspot.
The sourcelast is the last position of source.
The finish is sourcelast plus 1.
The begin is foundspot plus 1.
The domain is the slice of source from begin to finish.
Set domaintext to domain.
Set current to the slice of person from 0 to 1.
Set converted to current.
Lower from 0.
The firstletter is converted.
The lastspot is the last position of person.
The localsize is lastspot plus 1.
The endspot is localsize minus 1.
Set current to the slice of person from endspot to localsize.
Set converted to current.
Lower from 0.
The lastletter is converted.
Set line to empty text.
Place firstletter into line.
Pad from 0 with localsize minus 2.
Place lastletter into line.
Place "@" into line.
Set softened to empty text.
Soften from 0.
Place softened into line.
Show line.

To gather digits from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of source, return.
The piece is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece comes before lowdigit, Gather digits from spot plus 1, return.
If highdigit comes before piece, Gather digits from spot plus 1, return.
Place piece into digits.
Gather digits from spot plus 1.

To cloak.
Set digits to empty text.
Gather digits from 0.
The lastdigit is the last position of digits.
The start is lastdigit minus 3.
The tail is the slice of digits from start to lastdigit plus 1.
Set line to empty text.
Place "***-***-" into line.
Place tail into line.
Show line.

The postal is 0.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of source.
The piece is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches "@", set postal to 1.

If postal is 1, Veil.
If postal is 0, Cloak.
